            "sid": "1SA 14:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Sauri asookiri kuimukia öbhögambi igörö ya Isiraeri, naitaini abhabhisa bhaae ichintahana chonsui: Agaisiira Abhamoabhu, Abhaamoni, Abhaetomu, abhagambi bha Sobha na Abhabhirisiti. Na këra nkaaga aarë guitana iriihi, naarë gökëra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitani köbhökarë, agakëra Abhaamareki na köbhohoria Isiraeri kurua kömabhoko ga abhantö bhano bharë köbhaitania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
